{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_st01","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_st01","title":"华丽大圆舞曲","storyCode":"LE-ST-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"8a5df9eb6e793bc17587d3713d170888625779932e8af536a4d31c5a85942cbb","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"地处莱塔尼亚维谢海姆市的夕照区传来感染者病情异常好转的消息，为一探究竟，芙蓉来到此地。正值知名音乐家车尔尼的告别音乐会选拔期间，贵族青年黑键与流浪者白垩报名参加音乐会。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"“天空湛蓝晴朗，\n微风轻声歌唱；\n河水潺潺流淌，\n我的心充满希望。\n阴霾一夕散尽，\n大地迎接晨光；\n赞美莱塔尼亚，\n自由之人的故乡。”\n——《晴空之歌》（1078）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（按照地图，这里已经离罗德岛办事处不远了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（进入维谢海姆时耽搁了一会儿，不过快走几步，应该还能在预定时间到达办事处......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请留步！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，就是你，美丽的女士！我没见过你，请问你是第一次到夕照区来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我是罗德岛的干员，来夕照区调查感染者异常好转现象——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时忘掉那些身份和任务吧，我在此诚挚地邀请你与我合奏一曲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"合奏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我这把长笛是买来当法杖用的，我一首曲子也不会吹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系！只要你能吹响它，我就有信心将这几个音变成一首乐曲，并把它赠送给你，女士，纪念这美好的一天！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和别人约了时间，现在已经快迟到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，别担心。这么美好的天气，无论是谁，都会允许一些小小的延迟的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，不会花很长时间的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我......随便吹几个音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（还好还好，吹响了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哆......发......啦......嗦......发......咪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，一个充满希望的动机！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾玛，我来奏乐，请你和我们的客人共舞一曲如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"共舞？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开朗的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，美丽的小姐，让我们跳起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我真的没时间，我的舞跳得也——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开朗的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，大家都有跳得不好的时候，没人会笑话你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，我会用三拍子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一二三一二三，预备——起！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我踩了你好多下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开朗的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，和你共舞很愉快！感谢你的配合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见！祝你拥有美好的一天！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开朗的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎来到夕照区！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢，谢谢你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"干员装束的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，芙蓉~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......办事处的行板？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错！欢迎来到维谢海姆的夕照区！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦你了，特意跑到这儿来接我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不只是来接你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说你在出发来夕照区之前，一直在给自己加压，每天都熬到很晚，直到从本舰出发之前还在看论文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你今天的全部工作就是放松！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实没问题的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行，一直这么紧绷着，弦可是会断的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，你来的时间也很巧，一个星期之后就是车尔尼先生的告别音乐会，今天正好是报名日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据说车尔尼先生要在夕照厅前的广场上演奏，晚去一会儿可能就结束了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是任务......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"机会难得，任务明天再说！走啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g7_concerthall_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是夕照厅，据说夕照区的名字就是从这座音乐厅来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......到底是建筑，还是一件巨大的乐器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，夕照厅跑不了，之后再来观赏也不迟。今天的重点是车尔尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生......我来之前读到过，他好像是夕照区出身的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，他可是迄今为止唯一一个享誉莱塔尼亚的感染者音乐家，甚至还在国内举行过小范围的巡回演出——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了，他在那边！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"音乐家站在音乐厅外的阶梯上，身旁立着一面一人高的巨大乐器。\n以他站立的位置为圆心，有一个直径大约五米的无人的半圆。\n半圆之外，人山人海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不得了，夕照区至少有一半的人到这儿来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一半？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生以前常在这儿露天演奏。但近半年来他身体不好，今天是他第一次回到这里，大家都很激动——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）演奏要开始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"钢琴声一起，广场上很快安静下来。\n几乎所有人都停止了交谈。\n就连刚刚一直叫卖不停的小贩也压低了声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"曲子不长。\n车尔尼的演奏一结束，山呼海啸般的掌声就响了起来。\n掌声渐歇，车尔尼正准备弹奏下一曲，一个衣着整洁的人挤过人群，站到了他身边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生，我代表格特鲁德女士向您问好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，是你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特鲁德女士让我提醒您，不管是报名会，还是音乐会当天，都没有安排您的露天演奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有安排又怎样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他地方可能有所谓的安排，但在夕照区，谁也别想阻止我为大家演奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的身体状况不佳，最好还是不要劳累过度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的身体怎么样，我自己最知道。如果不是今天感觉好些，我也不会来这儿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去告诉格特鲁德，管好她自己的事，别来对我指手画脚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人是什么来头，大家怎么一言不发？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是格特鲁德·斯特罗洛女士的侍从。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特鲁德·斯特罗洛......斯特罗洛伯爵，维谢海姆的领主？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，那人被车尔尼先生三两句话就打发走了，看着真解气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一会儿就进夕照厅吧，报名会快开始了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"见贵族的身影消失在人群中，车尔尼清了清嗓子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢大家的支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天来，不仅是想久违地为大家弹上几段，也是想为一周后的音乐会预热。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请各位踊跃参加今天的报名会，在台上证明自己对音乐的热爱，我会在这里为大家加油。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天，我还将在选拔赛上出场把关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，我再为大家弹奏几首曲子，也欢迎各位拿出自己擅长的乐器，不论是配合我，还是自由发挥，我都欢迎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢大家！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"车尔尼鞠了一躬，滞重的沉默终于被驱散，人群中爆发出更热烈的掌声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，你也来这儿做生意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咖啡店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在就数夕照厅门前人多，我不来这儿，还能去哪儿啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话是这么说，我可不觉得有人愿意喝你的咖啡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咖啡店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可说不定——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老板，麻烦来一份酸渍卷心菜，要大碗的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咖啡店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咖啡店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翘首企盼的群众，强撑病体的音乐家，碰了一鼻子灰的贵族......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咖啡店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）真动人啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g6_whitehome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，你还是非要去报名参加音乐会不可吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我还是想去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，你少有这么不听人劝的时候，想去就去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢爷爷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报完名立刻回来，别在外面乱逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尽量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据说这次报名会需要选手现场演奏一段，展现自己的水平......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你的大提琴早就坏了，现在能用的只剩一把弓子，怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，他们还提供公用乐器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，他们也真周到。怎么就没人来告诉我这些呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷，您......生气了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会，我只是有点不放心罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我保证，报名会一结束我就回来，不会乱跑的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把泡好的热茶放在灶边了，您一会儿记得喝，别放凉了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年龄稍长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报名会快开始了，您该出发了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我仍然不能相信，您特地把我从乌提卡叫到这儿来，就是为了让我在这场满是感染者的音乐会上报名？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年龄稍长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和感染者进行这种程度的交流是没有危险的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用您说我也知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想说的是，我不明白，您为什么要为了一场普普通通的音乐会，特意把我邀请过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年龄稍长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您一直想呼吸一些自由的空气，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这倒也没错，可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年龄稍长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在就不要顾虑太多，享受平民的节日气氛吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（耸肩）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年龄稍长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车已经备好了。从高庭区到夕照区还是有一段路的，为了不影响您在报名会上的发挥，我不推荐您走路过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您的好意。再见，斯特罗洛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年龄稍长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您忘了，我更喜欢被人称名，而不是姓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，格特鲁德女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g7_concerthall_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好长的队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这边是报名的队伍啦，像我们这种看热闹的，走这边就好~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，请问......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是来报名的吧？队尾在那边，去排着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——好长！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有好多人从凌晨就开始排队了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我很急，我想早点完成报名，我爷爷还在家里等我照顾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。都是夕照区的，谁家里还没个需要照顾的人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快去排队吧，一会儿队更长了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不能通融一下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说了不行就是不行，这可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，你——您是一位贵族？您来报名参加我们的音乐会？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您看出来了，能不能帮我和这位朋友行个方便呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们的原则是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，您打算拒绝一位贵族诚心诚意的请求？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢您的理解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没听到吗，人家已经给我们放行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g10_stage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有请下一位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问您如何称呼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都叫我白垩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您擅长演奏的乐器是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是大提琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您自己的大提琴没带在身边吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有大提琴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我们为乐手们提供了公用乐器，您可以自行取用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，您可以开始了，注意时长不得超过一分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您还有什么问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚没来得及问，参加音乐会的报酬是怎么定的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报酬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我音乐会消息的人说，只要能入选，就能获得一笔丰厚的报酬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的爷爷病得很重，我需要钱给他治病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很同情您的遭遇，但这次音乐会不会有任何物质奖励。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有任何报酬？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，绝大多数人都会觉得，在车尔尼先生的告别音乐会上与他同台共演，就是最好的报酬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是否演奏都由您自己决定。不过，如果您真的决定离开，我希望，您至少能为我们留下一段美妙的旋律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"白垩有些沮丧地鞠了一躬。\n他慢慢坐下，把琴夹在两膝中间。\n当他一手持弓，一手按弦时，脸上的沮丧已经一扫而空，只剩专注。\n流丽的旋律从琴弦中间流淌出来，渐渐充满整个音乐厅。\n几个小节之后，白垩的演奏渐入佳境，舞台之下却响起了意料之外的长笛声。\n那位一袭黑衣的贵族吹着长笛，配合着白垩的大提琴声，缓缓走上舞台。\n白垩吃了一惊，但还是按照自己的节奏拉完了整个乐段，而那位贵族则在大提琴结束后，吹奏出一段短短的华彩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g10_stage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一分钟到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我今天听过最美的演奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得，我们应该向这两位年轻人致以敬意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问您也是来报名参加音乐会的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来是想一个人报名的，但白垩先生的演奏实在令人印象深刻，我们刚刚又有一面之缘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想错过与如此高超的乐手合作的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。请问您的名字是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像您这样的人......黑键？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您确定吗，黑键真的是您的本名，而不是您刚刚盯着钢琴看的时候想出来的假名？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您未免太多疑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，又不只钢琴上才有键，难道长笛上就没有键了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算如此，您的家系和封地——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再重复一次，我就叫黑键。还有什么问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，既然您和白垩先生并无约定，你们是否作为组合报名，还需要由他做决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩先生，您意下如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我来报名参加音乐会的目的......就是爷爷的医药费......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果白垩同意和我组队，我很愿意为他和他的爷爷提供经济上的资助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种资助不可能不附带条件，您千万想清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去年就有音乐家被人欺骗，签下了极为不公平的合同......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请您放尊重些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我愿意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就不多说什么了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位如果要以长笛和大提琴参加选拔，那么可选的就只有《晨暮》这首曲子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一首钢琴伴奏的长笛大提琴二重奏，也是车尔尼先生的代表作之一，两位觉得如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这首曲子是我学习长笛的契机，能在车尔尼先生的舞台上演奏这首曲目，我感到非常荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也觉得没问题！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g9_auditorium"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个贵族为什么要帮白垩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多音乐家都有贵族资助人，这也没什么奇怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些贵族是因为自己水平不足，见到技艺高超的音乐家就往上凑，想给自己脸上也贴点金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于这个黑键，我也搞不懂，可能真的只是惺惺相惜吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是有点不放心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我们可以收治白垩的爷爷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，你是来调查感染者异常好转现象的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，我们办事处太小，也没有收治住院患者的条件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"检查、诊断，给轻症患者投药，帮需要住院的患者联系其他机构，这就是我们的极限了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我还是有点担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......反正白垩的报名也结束了，我们现在就去找他问问，看看能不能给他提供一些帮助，怎么样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g4_embassy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"检测结果出来了。体细胞与源石融合率百分之八，血液源石结晶密度0.23单位每升......不能说特别糟，但是也绝对谈不上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一般来说，如果指标已经到了这种程度，无论患者自己感觉如何，都应该接受正规治疗，建议住院静养。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正规治疗、住院静养......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说罗德岛也是商业机构，就算你们看我可怜，给我免费检查，但这些总不可能不收费了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在维谢海姆有一些合作机构，可以把患者转给他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些机构和罗德岛是有合作协议的，相比其他地方，价格更低一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考虑到你的实际情况，我也可以试着跟他们再砍砍价，或者帮你们冲抵一部分费用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我早知道白垩是为了我才去报名，我说什么也不会让他去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，我再说一遍，你把钱退给那位贵族老爷，我们走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个贵族平白无故给你一笔钱，你想过背后可能有什么在等着你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可黑键也只是想让我陪他合奏而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算他没恶意，可——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，就算他没恶意，我一个到处流浪的老头子，既没有高贵的身份，也没有有权有势的朋友，连利用的价值都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算那些医院不拒收我，也不可能给我什么好脸色看。我可不想去那边仰人鼻息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你觉得那个贵族老爷没恶意，你就用这笔钱当本钱，做个安身立命的生意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我已经跟黑键说好了，他给我的这笔钱是给爷爷治病用的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你嫌我烦了，想把我扔在医院不管我了，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会，我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不在那些机构，而在这儿静养呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，我理解你的心情......可是我们这儿没有床位，药物储备也是应对突发事件用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果让老先生在这儿静养，我们就可以更严密地监控他的健康状况，这对我们的调查一定有帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以把自己睡的访客用床腾给这位老先生，至于药物，就按照合作机构的价格出售。事后我会写报告解释情况的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样在流程上应该没问题吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像......也说得过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们这边就没问题。老先生，您呢？这样您可以接受吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我保证，我们会以您的治疗为最优先事项，一切研究项目都以知情同意为前提，绝对不会做出有损您健康的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我最近还要和黑键练习合奏，可能没有太多时间照顾您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说这里的条件比家里好得多，您在这里，我也能放心一些......爷爷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚我回家收拾些东西，明天早上再来，这总行吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
